<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		The abaddon's abdomen draws over her right wing in the north view (user's
		report, 2026-10-03: "the abdomen is displaying in front of the wing").

		VRE ships the sack's look as a render node on VRE_SpawningSack_Cosmetic,
		parented to the Body tag, and gives it layer -3 in every view except the
		north one, which carries 90. Big & Small's wing tracker draws the wings at
		-2, -1 and 92, and its right back wing has no north override, so it keeps
		-2 and layer 90 lands on top of it. The matching left back wing is
		`visibleFacing East` and is not drawn in the north view at all, which is why
		the report names the right wing alone.

		The value is -3, the layer the same node already carries in the south, east
		and west views - the layer the wings are drawn against there. Nothing else
		moves: no other view changes, and the only other pawns it can touch are the
		VRE insectoids who carry the same sack.

		Gated on VRE Insector by display name: the xpath can only match that mod's
		gene, and a patch operation that matches nothing is an error in the log.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
		<mods>
			<li>Vanilla Races Expanded - Insector</li>
		</mods>
		<match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
			<xpath>Defs/*[defName="VRE_SpawningSack_Cosmetic"]/renderNodeProperties/li/drawData/dataNorth/layer</xpath>
			<value>
				<layer>-3</layer>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>
</Patch>
